        "编码器—解码器注意力中的 Q、K、V 全部来自解码器。"
      ],
      "knowledge_point_snapshot": [
        {
          "canonical_name": "传统seq2seq的长序列局限",
          "course_id": "course_ai_algorithms_systems",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "gold-ev-7056e327e4d297eadf4eeb60f00fcf21"
          ],
          "gold_kp_id": "gold-kp-124478c59a174f685eb27731b0777556",
          "importance": "supporting",
          "record_sha256": "5f2c55b198279047dbbee7200f225cce93f22562408957c67397b70b432852a4",
          "section_ids": [
            "ds3-scope-docx-3-5-3"
          ],
          "summary": "在自然语言处理传统的序列到序列（Sequence-to-Sequence，seq2seq）任务中，传统的seq2seq模型在处理长句子或者长距离依赖关系时，往往会面临信息丢失和模糊化的挑战，这是由于其固定长度的隐藏状态无法有效地捕捉到长序列中的重要信息。"
        },
        {
          "canonical_name": "注意力机制中Q、K、V的来源",
          "course_id": "course_ai_algorithms_systems",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "gold-ev-9abde4ba81915c311db9ade93789806e"
          ],
          "gold_kp_id": "gold-kp-66ae2b25924aac9fd92347d0a5f67061",
          "importance": "core",
          "record_sha256": "654ffbd898be791f07e69206b7d4a32bb5ab4c135734610a7ebc7c34865642ed",
          "section_ids": [
            "ds3-scope-docx-3-5-3"
          ],
          "summary": "注意力机制中，Q、K、V通常来自两个不同地方，其中Q来自解码器（Decoder）中的当前位置的隐藏状态或输出，K和V通常来自编码器（Encoder）中的所有位置的隐藏状态或输出，包含了输入序列的信息；"
        },
        {
          "canonical_name": "Transformer编码器结构",
          "course_id": "course_ai_algorithms_systems",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "gold-ev-520d6a9a5468ceca52daee6f7de7e998"
          ],
          "gold_kp_id": "gold-kp-ef904a521f09a778f872f0879db3a10e",
          "importance": "core",
          "record_sha256": "3d8114056d2a69bffaa92d561a217dc732221397e267eb1b79440d367a1acca8",
          "section_ids": [
            "ds3-scope-docx-3-5-3"
          ],
          "summary": "其中，编码器包括输入嵌入层（Input Embedding）、位置编码（Positional Encoding）和多个相同的模块，每个模块由多头自注意力机制层（Multi-Head Attention）和全连接前馈神经网络层（Feed Forward）组成。"
        },
        {
          "canonical_name": "编码器-解码器注意力",
          "course_id": "course_ai_algorithms_systems",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "gold-ev-baaff1e84d4d4e0415499eef709178cd"
          ],
          "gold_kp_id": "gold-kp-a4ac5b5c2b47bccc1653b1c20260c9c5",
          "importance": "core",
          "record_sha256": "18ca5612993502fceb73c7d794203f038b97742716a82a2d9b1d8fad233da8ee",
          "section_ids": [
            "ds3-scope-docx-3-5-3"
          ],
          "summary": "编码器-解码器注意力机制层的Q矩阵由解码器上一个子网络的输出计算得到，K矩阵和V矩阵由编码器输出编码矩阵计算得到。"
        }
      ],
